<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 6.449 billion pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 6.449 billion pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 6.449 billion pesos from the secondary market on Wednesday through six auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>900 million  16 days</p>
<p>900 million  15 days</p>
<p>900 million  14 days</p>
<p>1.200 million   9 days</p>
<p>1.300 million   6 days</p>
<p>1.249 million   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
